"[npm registry](https://www.npmjs.com/). Installation is done using the "
"[`npm install` command](https://docs.npmjs.com/getting-started"
"/installing-npm-packages-locally):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:23
msgid "TypeScript"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:25
msgid ""
"This module includes a [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/) "
"declaration file to enable auto complete in compatible editors and type "
"information for TypeScript projects. This module depends on the Node.js "
"types, so install `@types/node`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:34
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:40
msgid "getRawBody(stream, [options], [callback])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:42
msgid ""
"**Returns a promise if no callback specified and global `Promise` "
"exists.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:44
msgid "Options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:46
msgid ""
"`length` - The length of the stream. If the contents of the stream do not"
" add up to this length, an `400` error code is returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:49
msgid ""
"`limit` - The byte limit of the body. This is the number of bytes or any "
"string format supported by [bytes](https://www.npmjs.com/package/bytes), "
"for example `1000`, `'500kb'` or `'3mb'`. If the body ends up being "
"larger than this limit, a `413` error code is returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:55
msgid ""
"`encoding` - The encoding to use to decode the body into a string. By "
"default, a `Buffer` instance will be returned when no encoding is "
"specified. Most likely, you want `utf-8`, so setting `encoding` to `true`"
" will decode as `utf-8`. You can use any type of encoding supported by "
"[iconv-lite](https://www.npmjs.org/package/iconv-lite#readme)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:60
msgid ""
"You can also pass a string in place of options to just specify the "
"encoding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:62
msgid ""
"If an error occurs, the stream will be paused, everything unpiped, and "
"you are responsible for correctly disposing the stream. For HTTP "
"requests, you may need to finish consuming the stream if you want to keep"
" the socket open for future requests. For streams that use file "
"descriptors, you should `stream.destroy()` or `stream.close()` to prevent"
" leaks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:69
msgid "Errors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:71
msgid ""
"This module creates errors depending on the error condition during "
"reading. The error may be an error from the underlying Node.js "
"implementation, but is otherwise an error created by this module, which "
"has the following attributes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:75
msgid "`limit` - the limit in bytes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:76
msgid "`length` and `expected` - the expected length of the stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:77
msgid "`received` - the received bytes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:78
msgid "`encoding` - the invalid encoding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:79
msgid "`status` and `statusCode` - the corresponding status code for the error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:80
msgid "`type` - the error type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:82
msgid "Types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:84
msgid ""
"The errors from this module have a `type` property which allows for the "
"programmatic determination of the type of error returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:87
msgid "encoding.unsupported"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:89
msgid ""
"This error will occur when the `encoding` option is specified, but the "
"value does not map to an encoding supported by the [iconv-"
"lite](https://www.npmjs.org/package/iconv-lite#readme) module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:93
msgid "entity.too.large"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:95
msgid ""
"This error will occur when the `limit` option is specified, but the "
"stream has an entity that is larger."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:98
msgid "request.aborted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:100
msgid ""
"This error will occur when the request stream is aborted by the client "
"before reading the body has finished."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:103
msgid "request.size.invalid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:105
msgid ""
"This error will occur when the `length` option is specified, but the "
"stream has emitted more bytes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:108
msgid "stream.encoding.set"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:110
msgid ""
"This error will occur when the given stream has an encoding set on it, "
"making it a decoded stream. The stream should not have an encoding set "
"and is expected to emit `Buffer` objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:114
msgid "stream.not.readable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/raw-body_README.md:116
msgid "This error will occur when the given stream is not readable."
msgstr ""

